# The Windows batch file must reach Windows with CRLF endings and must not be
# touched by any text filter: cmd.exe mis-parses a comment line containing
# non-ASCII bytes, and what it corrupts is the lines AFTER it -- a failure that
# looks like a bug in the build rather than in the file's encoding.
# Windows 批次檔必須以 CRLF 抵達 Windows，且不得被任何文字 filter 動到：cmd.exe
# 在註解含非 ASCII 位元組時會解析錯誤，而它弄壞的是「該行之後」的行——那個失敗
# 看起來像建置的 bug，而不是檔案編碼的問題。
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Fixtures whose whole point is a specific byte sequence must never be
# normalised. test_csv2.zsh generates most of them for this reason, but the
# committed one is protected here too.
# 重點就在特定位元組序列的 fixture 絕不可被正規化。test_csv2.zsh 為此在腳本內
# 產生大多數素材，而已進版控的那一份在此一併保護。
*.csv  -text
*.csv2 -text
